message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Chord Diagram Studio"
abstract: >-
  Chord Diagram Studio turns Spearman correlation and p-value matrices from
  Excel into publication-ready chord diagrams. It shows only significant
  correlations between variable categories, and lets you exclude, combine or
  keep apart categories, build a series of diagrams, and count correlations by
  sign and strength. Available as a browser application and as desktop
  programs for Mac, Windows and Linux.
